OL,3,GNEWSALead theft from roof 'punch in the
OL,4,Agut' for church
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have sunk to "a new low" after
OL,7,Fstripping the lead from a Staines
OL,8,Fchurch roof and leaving it exposed to
OL,9,Fthe elements, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FSt Peter's Church, in Laleham Road, was
OL,12,Ftargeted over the weekend with lead
OL,13,Fremoved from part of the church roof on
OL,14,Fthe west porch river entrance.
OL,16,FHarry Boparai, who will represent the
OL,17,Farea on the new West Surrey Council,
OL,18,Fsaid the theft was a "punch in the gut"
OL,19,Ffor all involved.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
